, 'duration': 4.238}, page_content='I am a big coffee\ndrinker and I only have water.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '539.305', 'duration': 3.17}, page_content='And on day 28, Bailey clearly needed\nentertainment.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '545.077', 'duration': 0.768}, page_content='So by day 30'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '545.878', 'duration': 2.403}, page_content='I had the perfect plan\nto get them to spend money.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '548.481', 'duration': 2.069}, page_content="It's now day 30 and\nit's time for another offer."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '550.583', 'duration': 1.902}, page_content="- How's it going?\n- Hi."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '552.485', 'duration': 1.368}, page_content="Today's offer is simple."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '553.853', 'duration': 2.335}, page_content='Each of these five items\ncost $10,000.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '556.255', 'duration': 3.37}, page_content='You can buy one phone call,\nthe entire Harry Potter collection,'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '559.625', 'duration': 3.27}, page_content='your own coffee machine, spices,\nsalt and pepper for your food.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '562.895', 'duration': 2.169}, page_content='Or you can buy a monopoly\nfor $10,000.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '565.097', 'duration': 2.036}, page_content='You could buy one of them.\nYou can buy all five of them.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '567.133', 'duration': 2.602}, page_content='This is tough, actually.\nYou have 10 minutes to decide.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '569.869', 'duration': 0.934}, page_content='Just let me know what you want.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '570.803', 'duration': 0.834}, page_content="I'm so nervous."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '571.637', 'duration': 2.036}, page_content='- This is a big decision.\n- Coffee?'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '574.173', 'duration': 2.269}, page_co