': 1.868}, page_content="All right.\nGive me $20,000 and I'll go get them."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '854.019', 'duration': 1.902}, page_content='Best 10K ever spent,\nI think.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '856.188', 'duration': 0.734}, page_content='Okay.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '856.922', 'duration': 1.936}, page_content='They paid the 20 grand.\nCome on in.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '859.058', 'duration': 1.001}, page_content="I'm so excited."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '866.732', 'duration': 2.069}, page_content='It was a tough decision.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '868.801', 'duration': 1.601}, page_content='I made you a birthday gift.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '870.402', 'duration': 2.97}, page_content='And to celebrate her birthday,\nwe brought a birthday cake.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '876.508', 'duration': 3.07}, page_content="This is the best tasty thing\nthey've had in forever."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '879.578', 'duration': 2.303}, page_content="It's little things like that\nthat you don't realize"), Document(metadata={'start_time': '881.881', 'duration': 2.268}, page_content="you won't have\nuntil you're in it."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '884.149', 'duration': 0.968}, page_content='Bye! Love you.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '885.117', 'duration': 1.001}, page_content='Bye!'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '886.485', 'duration': 2.202}, page_content="That's the worst feeling so far."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '888.687', 'duration': 1.402}, page_content='The highest of highs.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '890.089', 'duration': 4.037}, page_content='And now back to our little cube\nall alone.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '894.66', 'duration': 2.035}, page_content="Like I said earlier,\nthe things we're offering"), Document(metadata={'start_time': '896.695', 'duration': 1.235}, page_content='them are based off of what'), Document