ocument(metadata={'start_time': '1478.243', 'duration': 1.368}, page_content='take your blindfolds off.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1480.745', 'duration': 3.537}, page_content="So you might be familiar\nwith what we're about to offer you."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1484.816', 'duration': 4.071}, page_content='You each have the choice to split\nthe money, and nothing changes.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1488.887', 'duration': 1.602}, page_content='You both hit split.\nYou just split it.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1490.489', 'duration': 1.167}, page_content='Keep what you have,'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1491.656', 'duration': 3.604}, page_content="or if you hit steal, you can steal\nthe other person's money."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1495.494', 'duration': 2.068}, page_content='And if you both hit\nsteal, you would get nothing.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1498.797', 'duration': 1.735}, page_content='Suzie has earplugs in'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1500.565', 'duration': 2.202}, page_content='and noise cancellation\nheadphones on top of them.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1502.767', 'duration': 2.236}, page_content="She can't hear us.\nWhat's going through your head?"), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1505.003', 'duration': 5.772}, page_content="I don't even know, Suzie\nif you put steal, I can't imagine."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1511.009', 'duration': 2.402}, page_content='What do you say to somebody\nthat steals 180? Whatever.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1513.411', 'duration': 2.236}, page_content='Maybe you get ahead of it\nand you steal it.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1515.647', 'duration': 0.634}, page_content='Fair.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1516.281', 'duration': 1.168}, page_content='Do you hear that?'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1517.449', 'duration': 1.768}, page_content='Bailey actually might.\nBailey might.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1519.217', 'duration': 2.736}, page_content='All right.\nthrow the music back in his ears.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1521.953', 'duration': 1.569}, page_content='What if while we were over there,\nhe was like,'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1523.555', 'duration': 1.668}, page_content='"Oh, this is a no brainer.\nIt\'s too much money"'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1525.257', 'duration': 1.034}, page_content='We would never speak again.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1526.291', 'duration': 1.935}, page_content='You guys have become, like,\nsuch close friends.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1528.226', 'duration': 1.535}, page_content="I don't know.\nYou get to know anyone."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1529.761', 'duration': 2.636}, page_content="And when you've gone\nthrough the same thing"), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1532.397', 'duration': 4.138}, page_content='and like how hard this challenge has\nbeen, we both deserve half for sure.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1536.568', 'duration': 2.069}, page_content="But now you're making me nervous."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1538.637', 'duration': 1.868}, page_content='Like I could do it, too.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1541.172', 'duration': 1.068}, page_content='What did she just say?'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1542.24', 'duration': 2.236}, page_content="Maybe it'll be a case of you\nthinking of someone."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1544.509', 'duration': 0.667}, page_content="I don't know."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1545.21', 'duration': 1.468}, page_content='If both of them press the steal button,'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1546.678', 'duration': 2.236}, page_content='they literally spend 100 days\nin this room together'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1549.08', 'duration': 1.068}, page_content='for absolutely nothing.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1550.148', 'duration': 3.404}, page_content="There's 30 seconds left in the\nchallenge at the very last second."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1553.685', 'duration': 2.069}, page_content='I want you both to place your vote.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1555.754', 'duration': 3.403}, page_content='Do you want to walk away\nwith 360 grand or half of it?'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1559.324', 'duration': 0.734}, page_content='No one speak.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1560.058', 'duration': 1.835}, page_content="Karl and Kris,\nyou two don't talk either."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1561.893', 'duration': 3.27}, page_content='I know that Suzie is going to split,\nbut the thought of walking away'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1565.163', 'duration': 4.438}, page_content='with almost $360,000,\nI could do so much.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1569.634', 'duration': 1.936}, page_content='Do you want to split the money\nor steal it?'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1571.57', 'duration': 1.668}, page_content='The fact that I entered this\nchallenge,'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1573.238', 'duration': 0.701}, page_content='Three.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1573.939', 'duration': 1.301}, page_content='Knowing that'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1575.24', 'duration': 2.135}, page_content='there would be pretty dark\ntimes ahead'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1577.375', 'duration': 0.768}, page_content='Two.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1578.143', 'duration': 2.235}, page_content='And I still overcame all those things'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1580.378', 'duration': 0.768}, page_content='One.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1581.146', 'duration': 1.668}, page_content="There's no price you can put on that."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1584.916', 'duration': 1.001}, page_content='No way.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1585.917', 'duration': 2.469}, page_content='If the room turns red,\nthen someone stole.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1588.887', 'duration': 2.803}, page_content='If the room turns green,\nthen you split the money.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1592.791', 'duration': 1.368}, page_content='You both chose split!'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1594.159', 'duration': 1.067}, page_content='Yes!'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1595.894', 'duration': 0.934}, page_content='Yes!'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1597.028', 'duration': 1.835}, page_content='Congratulations on surviving!'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1598.863', 'duration': 0.735}, page_content='- Yeah!\n- Yes!'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1599.731', 'duration': 3.337}, page_content="There you go, there's your money!\nFollow me out here."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1605.937', 'duration': 1.435}, page_content="And like I said\nearlier in the video, don't"), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1607.372', 'duration': 1.268}, page_content='forget to download the Shop app.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1608.64', 'duration': 1.635}, page_content='If you go on my store\nin the Shop app,'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1610.275', 'duration': 1.702}, page_content='you can tell me whatever you want\nfor the holiday.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1611.977', 'duration': 1.935}, page_content="And I'm going to be fulfilling\nthousands of wishes."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1613.912', 'duration': 2.703}, page_content='You can say\nlike a Tesla, Yu-Gi-Oh cards.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1616.648', 'duration': 2.536}, page_content="Feastables bars, doesn't matter.\nThank you Shop app."), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1619.217', 'duration': 1.135}, page_content='I appreciate you so much.'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1620.352', 'duration': 1.067}, page_content='And as always,'), Document(metadata={'start_time': '1621.419', 'duration': 1.202}, page_content=' let’s blow this place up.')]
